      "role": "user",
      "content": "i know people say there's support, but it doesn't change the reality. the reality is that everything is just dying. it's like i'm just haunting my own life. sometimes i look at him and i just think... wouldn't it be faster if it just all stopped? if we could just be at peace instead of this long, slow dragging on? it feels like the only way to actually find some quiet is for everything to just be over.",
